# Design Rules

## v0 Leads Design
- All UI components, layouts, and styles originate from v0.
- Do not manually author globals.css, component styles, or design tokens.
- When adding new UI, create it in v0 first, then pull the code.
- shadcn/ui components in `src/components/ui/` come from v0 output.

## Theme
- Dark theme only. No light mode toggle.
- Base color: zinc (configured in components.json).
- Design for evening viewing during live football matches.
- High contrast text for mobile readability.

## Mobile-First
- Design for 375px viewport first, then scale up.
- Touch targets minimum 44px.
- Bottom navigation for primary app navigation.
- Swipeable/scrollable containers for match lists.
- Prediction inputs must be easy to use on mobile (large +/- buttons).

## Animation
- Subtle transitions for state changes.
- Celebration animations for high-scoring predictions.
- Live position change indicators (green up arrows, red down arrows).
- Countdown timer animations for prediction deadlines.
